---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../components/FinalCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Us | Apna Galla" description="Built for the way Indian shops actually work.">
  <div class="about-hero section">
    <div class="container hero-container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Built for the way Indian shops actually work.</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Fast billing, simple khata, flexible stock, and practical retail workflows.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>At Apna Galla, we understand that Indian retail is unique. You don't need complicated accounting software with hundreds of features you'll never use. You need a fast, reliable way to manage your daily shop operations.</p>
        
        <h2>Our Core Principles</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Speed is everything:</strong> If a system takes longer than a physical calculator and notebook, it's not working for you. Our billing is designed to be lightning fast.</li>
          <li><strong>Less typing, more doing:</strong> We minimize data entry so you can focus on serving customers.</li>
          <li><strong>Practical Khata:</strong> We know Udhar is a reality of business. Managing customer and supplier dues should be straightforward and stress-free.</li>
          <li><strong>Ask, don't search:</strong> Instead of digging through complex report menus, you should be able to just ask your business questions directly.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FinalCTA />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    background: var(--ag-surface-lowest);
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ag-divider);
  }
  .hero-container {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--ag-font-heading);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--ag-text-secondary);
  }
  
  .content-container {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
  
  .prose {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ag-text);
  }
  
  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .prose h2 {
    font-family: var(--ag-font-heading);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--ag-primary);
  }
  
  .prose ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .prose li::marker {
    color: var(--ag-primary-fixed);
  }
</style>
